title: loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>

<<setPhase NPC>>

<<if $dialogPhase == "begin">>
    <<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "comeback">>
    <<jump CheckForPhone>>
<<else>>
    <<jump CheckForPhone>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
Nicholas: Hello! I'm frantic—I left my phone back outside on the street. 
Nicholas: Could you head back out to the main scene and grab it for me?
-> Yes, I will find it.
    <<getPhase NPC "comeback">>  
    Nicholas: Thank you! I'll stay right here waiting for you.
-> No, look for it yourself.
    Nicholas: Well... that's incredibly rude of you.
===

title: CheckForPhone
---
<<if player_has_phone()>>
    Nicholas: Oh my goodness, you found my phone!
    Nicholas: Thank you so much for bringing it back into the house for me.
<<else>>
    Nicholas: Have you gotten my phone yet? Go back and get it!
    Nicholas: It should be out there in the main area.
<<endif>> 
===
